              ==================================================
              Geant4 - an Object-Oriented Toolkit for Simulation
              ==================================================

                                   Test15
                                   ------

Description:   This is a test of comparing the TARC experimental data with
               Geant4. In its basic form the test validates cascade, precompound
               and de-exictation models along with neutron production,
               interaction and transportation including the neutron_hp models.

Usage:	       test15 -m test15.in (-t nThreads -p PhysicsList)

Running:       test15 -m test15.in (or -m test15.large_N.in)

Type of test:  validation

Output:        Test15_output.root - plots can be produced: root -b test15_plots.C
